### Listar libros
GET http://localhost:3000/api/libros

### Listar disponibles
GET http://localhost:3000/api/libros?disponible=true

### Obtener libro por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/libros/1

### Crear libro
POST http://localhost:3000/api/libros
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Ficciones",
  "autor": "Jorge Luis Borges",
  "precio": 6500,
  "imagen": "https://example.com/ficciones.jpg",
  "disponible": true
}

### Actualizar libro
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/libros/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "El principito (Edición Especial)",
  "autor": "Antoine de Saint-Exupéry",
  "precio": 5500,
  "imagen": "https://example.com/principito-especial.jpg",
  "disponible": true
}

### Eliminar libro
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/libros/1

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ============================================
### CASOS FELICES
### ============================================

### Listar todos los libros (ahora con autor)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros

### Obtener libro por ID (con autor y categorías)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros/1

### Crear un libro
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/libros
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "El Aleph",
  "precio": 6000,
  "imagen": "https://example.com/el-aleph.jpg",
  "disponible": true,
  "autorId": 5
}

### ============================================
### CASOS DE ERROR (¡NUEVOS!)
### ============================================

### 400 - Sin título
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/libros
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "precio": 5000,
  "imagen": "https://example.com/sin-titulo.jpg",
  "autorId": 1
}

### 400 - ID inválido (abc no es número)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros/abc

### 400 - ID negativo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros/-5

### 400 - autorId inválido (no existe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/libros
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Libro huérfano",
  "precio": 5000,
  "imagen": "https://example.com/huerfano.jpg",
  "autorId": 9999
}

### 404 - Libro que no existe
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros/9999

### 409 - Autor duplicado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/autores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Gabriel García Márquez",
  "nacionalidad": "Colombia"
}

### 409 - Borrar autor con libros (onDelete: Restrict)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/autores/1

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros/1










@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ============================================
### 1. REGISTRO
### ============================================

### 1.1 Registro exitoso
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "email": "ana@libreria.test",
  "password": "Libreria2026"
}

### 1.2 Registro con email repetido → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana2",
  "email": "ana@libreria.test",
  "password": "Libreria2026"
}

### 1.3 Registro con password corta → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "email": "ana2@libreria.test",
  "password": "corta"
}

### ============================================
### 2. LOGIN
### ============================================

### 2.1 Login correcto (capturar token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@libreria.test",
  "password": "Admin1234"
}

### Guardar el token
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
@usuario = {{login.response.body.usuario}}

### 2.2 Login con mail inexistente → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "noexiste@libreria.test",
  "password": "Admin1234"
}

### 2.3 Login con password incorrecto → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@libreria.test",
  "password": "password_incorrecto"
}

### ============================================
### 3. RUTAS PROTEGIDAS (con token)
### ============================================

### 3.1 GET /api/auth/yo con token → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/yo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3.2 GET /api/auth/yo sin token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/yo

### 3.3 GET /api/auth/yo con token inválido → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/yo
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6Mywicm9sIjoiQ0xJRU5URSIsImlhdCI6MTc1NzE4NjUyN30.JJ8b9a1392VJkJoS2PxiGZyUnM9w6weefa8fLJ9er90

### ============================================
### 4. LIBROS - PÚBLICOS (sin token)
### ============================================

### 4.1 GET /api/libros → 200 (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros

### 4.2 GET /api/libros/1 → 200 (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros/1

### 4.3 GET /api/libros/abc → 400 (id inválido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/libros/abc

### ============================================
### 5. LIBROS - PROTEGIDOS (con token de ADMIN)
### ============================================

### 5.1 POST /api/libros con ADMIN → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/libros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "El Aleph",
  "precio": 6000,
  "imagen": "https://example.com/el-aleph.jpg",
  "disponible": true,
  "autorId": 1
}

### ============================================
### 6. LIBROS - PROTEGIDOS (con token de CLIENTE)
### ============================================

### Login como CLIENTE
# @name loginCliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cliente@libreria.test",
  "password": "Cliente1234"
}

@tokenCliente = {{loginCliente.response.body.token}}

### 6.1 POST /api/libros con CLIENTE → 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/libros
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenCliente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Intento de cliente",
  "precio": 5000,
  "imagen": "https://example.com/cliente.jpg",
  "disponible": true,
  "autorId": 1
}

### 6.2 POST /api/libros sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/libros
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Intento sin token",
  "precio": 5000,
  "imagen": "https://example.com/sin-token.jpg",
  "disponible": true,
  "autorId": 1
}

### ============================================
### 7. AUTORES - PROTEGIDOS (con token de ADMIN)
### ============================================

### 7.1 POST /api/autores con ADMIN → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/autores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Mario Vargas Llosa",
  "nacionalidad": "Perú"
}

### ============================================
### 8. CASOS DE CONFLICTO
### ============================================

### 8.1 Autor duplicado → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/autores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Gabriel García Márquez",
  "nacionalidad": "Colombia"
}

### 8.2 PUT /api/libros/999 → 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/libros/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "No existe"
}

### 8.3 DELETE /api/autores/1 (tiene libros) → 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/autores/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}